    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to follow and join us:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili: \u65e7\u662f\u73a9\u513f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Red Book: \u65e7\u662f\u73a9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 1022200878</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recently, community police officer Chen Han received a complaint from a neighbor in the same residential compound about noise disturbances caused by a homeowner's renovation. His superior assigned him to mediate the issue, so Chen Han set out with a noise detector. During this mission, Chen Han encountered a series of eerie phenomena beyond normal comprehension, leaving him utterly perplexed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Scene Graphics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/b8715fef8e1a3b2d99c2a4a09c71d9b6.poster.avif?t=1750367374\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/b8715fef8e1a3b2d99c2a4a09c71d9b6.webm?t=1750367374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/b8715fef8e1a3b2d99c2a4a09c71d9b6.mp4?t=1750367374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/2ec56a0a960939ca47775946e69df2d5.poster.avif?t=1750367374\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/2ec56a0a960939ca47775946e69df2d5.webm?t=1750367374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/2ec56a0a960939ca47775946e69df2d5.mp4?t=1750367374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/35240ac3ec4f7c4dd90c343cff1d9cbe.poster.avif?t=1750367374\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/35240ac3ec4f7c4dd90c343cff1d9cbe.webm?t=1750367374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/35240ac3ec4f7c4dd90c343cff1d9cbe.mp4?t=1750367374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WSAD to control movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E to interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift to sprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space to jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F to use flashlight</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to follow and join us:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili: \u65e7\u662f\u73a9\u513f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Red Book: \u65e7\u662f\u73a9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 1022200878</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recently, community police officer Chen Han received a complaint from a neighbor in the same residential compound about noise disturbances caused by a homeowner's renovation. His superior assigned him to mediate the issue, so Chen Han set out with a noise detector. During this mission, Chen Han encountered a series of eerie phenomena beyond normal comprehension, leaving him utterly perplexed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Scene Graphics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/b8715fef8e1a3b2d99c2a4a09c71d9b6.poster.avif?t=1750367374\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/b8715fef8e1a3b2d99c2a4a09c71d9b6.webm?t=1750367374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/b8715fef8e1a3b2d99c2a4a09c71d9b6.mp4?t=1750367374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/2ec56a0a960939ca47775946e69df2d5.poster.avif?t=1750367374\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/2ec56a0a960939ca47775946e69df2d5.webm?t=1750367374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/2ec56a0a960939ca47775946e69df2d5.mp4?t=1750367374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/35240ac3ec4f7c4dd90c343cff1d9cbe.poster.avif?t=1750367374\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/35240ac3ec4f7c4dd90c343cff1d9cbe.webm?t=1750367374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/35240ac3ec4f7c4dd90c343cff1d9cbe.mp4?t=1750367374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WSAD to control movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E to interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift to sprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space to jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F to use flashlight</p>",
